---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for ordering balloon decorations and services from Balloons Lane."
>
  <section class="post-hero">
    <div class="container"><h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class="meta">Last updated: 2025</p></div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="container post-body">
      <h2>1. Orders &amp; Quotes</h2>
      <p>All quotes are estimates based on the event details you provide (date, venue, design, guest count). A quote becomes a confirmed order once you approve it and pay the required deposit.</p>
      <h2>2. Deposits &amp; Payments</h2>
      <p>A 50% deposit is required to reserve your event date. The remaining balance is due before delivery or setup. Custom and personalized items are non-refundable once production begins.</p>
      <h2>3. Delivery &amp; Setup</h2>
      <p>Same-day local delivery is available across our New Jersey and New York City service areas, subject to availability. Delivery times are estimates; we will always communicate any delays promptly.</p>
      <h2>4. Cancellations</h2>
      <p>Cancellations made more than 7 days before the event receive a full deposit refund. Cancellations within 7 days forfeit the deposit, as materials and labor are already committed.</p>
      <h2>5. Outdoor Events</h2>
      <p>While we offer weatherproof options, extreme weather (high winds, storms) may affect balloon displays. We will work with you on alternatives or rescheduling where possible.</p>
      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Call <a href="tel:+17186752820">718-675-2820</a> or email <a href="mailto:balloonlaneny@gmail.com">balloonlaneny@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
